  "description": "Yoon Yu-No is a small-time money launderer with a huge problem: he can’t seem to escape the sexual advances of his client Vasily Ivanovich Kaminsky, a handsome yet deadly Russian mafia boss. Yu-No is terrified of Kaminsky and determined to escape from him, but his attraction to the other man complicates matters. Will Yu-No be able to resist Kaminsky’s overtures and save himself? Or will he be devoured by Kaminsky’s unrelenting obsession? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
